/T (The department runs BTech, MTech, MS\(R\), and Ph.D. programs and is known for its academic rigor, excellence, and cutting-edge research with several sponsored projects and consultancies. Some students convert their B.Tech. program into a dual degree program, which results in students getting both a B.Tech and an M.Tech. degree at the end of 5 years. The department has also started the M.S. program, which focuses on research in various domains of Computer Science.)
/E (The department runs BTech, MTech, MS\(R\), and Ph.D. programs and is known for its academic rigor, excellence, and cutting-edge research with several sponsored projects and consultancies. Some students convert their B.Tech. program into a dual degree program, which results in students getting both a B.Tech and an M.Tech. degree at the end of 5 years. The department has also started the M.S. program, which focuses on research in various domains of Computer Science.)
/Pg 9 0 R
>>
